nsactions faster than ever before.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll be doing:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own features end-to-end:</strong> Drive the product lifecycle from determining the initial problem space and user needs, to technical modeling, UX execution, and iterative improvements based on vague requirements.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Translate complexity to usability:</strong> Build out complex technical systems into intuitive, user-friendly interfaces.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build fraud-fighting tools:</strong> Develop and optimize advanced graph systems to visualize fraud rings, and build performant search tools that help analysts rapidly identify suspicious transactions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaborate cross-functionally:</strong> Work tightly with Design, Data, Product, and Account Management teams to align engineering output with business and user needs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ensure system health:</strong> Proactively diagnose, triage, and resolve bugs while writing highly efficient and performant code.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll need:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Core technical stack: </strong>Extensive experience writing efficient, production-ready code in TypeScript, Node.js, React, Go and other server programming languages.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Scale and data expertise: </strong>Proven experience working with data-intensive applications, complex workflows, and big data at scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pipeline proficiency: </strong>Deep background in technical data modeling and building robust production data pipelines.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-growth adaptability: </strong>The ability to thrive, execute, and deliver consistently in a fast-paced, high-growth startup environment.</p><p styl