ross our manufacturing and test facilities.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will help establish and continuously improve the health, safety, and environmental framework supporting the production and testing of battery, propulsion system and aircraft. Working closely with operations and engineering, you will combine hands-on shopfloor involvement with the development of scalable HSE processes, standards, and systems.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">From supporting daily safe operations in workshops and test areas to building risk assessments, SOPs, and governance structures, you will contribute directly to creating a robust and future-proof safety organisation as VÆRIDION transitions from prototype development to industrialisation.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Day-to-Day:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a daily point of contact for HSE topics on site in Edmo. </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support and monitor safe execution of activities in workshops, labs, and production areas.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure employees and contractors are properly instructed and trained.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Conduct regular safety walks, inspections, and hazard identification.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support incident management, including investigation and corrective actions.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure safe handling of hazardous materials, equipment, and test systems (e.g. battery testing, EPS rigs).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop, implement, and maintain risk assessments (Gefährdungsbeurteilungen).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create and maintain Standard Operating Procedures (Betriebsanweisungen) and safety concepts.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the definition and rollout of HSE standards and policies across sites.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain and further develop the HSE documentation and matrix structure.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate overarching safety topics such as waste management, HazMat, and access concepts.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure compliance with German occupational safety regulations (e.g. ArbSchG, DGUV).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interface with external safety authorities like company doctor and company health insurance (Berufsgenossenschaft).</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support audits, inspections, and regulatory requirements.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare and run the ASA (Arbeitsschutzausschuss) and Safety Steering Meetings.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support the setup of HSE structures for new facilities and activities.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the definition of roles, responsibilities, and safety organisation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help scale HSE processes from prototype environment to industrial operations.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive safety awareness and contribute to a strong safety culture.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Profile:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-heigh