quired.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health and safety due diligence for every new site and new market, with a clear view of the residual market risks.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Safety integrated into clinic design and construction, in partnership with the real estate and construction teams: contractor requirements and pre-qualification, site audits, and complete safety briefings at handover.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Emergency and evacuation plans agreed with the Global Security Lead.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Risk Management and Infrastructure</strong></em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A global health and safety management system, adapted locally for each market, that oversees day-to-day safety across every clinic and office.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Risk assessments for every clinic, office and build site, covering fire safety, first aid, manual handling and the use of medical equipment.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Controls for clinic-specific hazards, including clinical waste and the safe operation of medical equipment, aligned with local regulation and quality management systems.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A risk-based audit programme and a set of performance measures reported regularly to the COO.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Day to Day Operations</strong></em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ownership of Neko’s day-to-day health and safety management, so our members and staff are in a safe environment in every clinic.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Routine maintenance and compliance checks that control building risks includ