ion</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with Sales, Customer Success, Marketing, Supply Chain and RevOps to find, size and prioritise high-value AI use cases </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gather requirements and turn them into clear scopes, with defined phasing and acceptance criteria</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and ship skills, automations and AI capabilities with tools such as Claude Cowork, Claude Code and workflow automation platforms</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design larger or integration-heavy projects (e.g. connectors to core systems, a shared knowledge base or “second brain”) and work with IT and Engineering to implement them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive adoption by onboarding users, gathering feedback and iterating on what's live</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Safeguard compliance with AI governance, data protection (GDPR) and InfoSec/IT standards, working closely with IT on approved tools, access and guardrails</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support commercial leadership with target account list prioritisation through structured analysis, data enrichment and recommendations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate sales outreach plays with Sales and Marketing, keeping execution aligned and on track, with scope to automate outreach plays over time</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map, design and improve commercial processes, and find where AI or automation can remove friction</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Give senior commercial leadership clear updates, analysis and recommendations</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Skills</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on, builder mindset: you'd rather prototype something than write a long deck about it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong grasp of low-code, automation and AI tooling, including prompting, workflow design and light scripting</p></li>