tack services in Python and Typescript, creating novel geospatial services to solve challenging and unique problems we face in building our AI driving products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with internal teams to understand requirements and build solutions with global geospatial data.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and build data pipelines with PySpark and Databricks to enrich fleet data with mapping and road-network information at global scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build applications and datasets that support route planning and the preparation of map data for training and simulation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Integrate with navigation and mapping APIs from providers such as Mapbox, TomTom and Google Maps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain, support and improve the services the team already runs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deploy and operate your services on Azure and Kubernetes, owning them end to end.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧩 What you’ll be working on</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Global-scale geospatial enrichment pipelines that tell us where we’ve driven and what the road network looks like.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Route-planning applications and datasets that help our teams decide where to drive next.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map data preparation for model training and simulation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">New services you’ll take from idea to production and lead end to end.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🙌 You should apply if</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are a strong, hands-on Python engineer who can deliver high-quality production code at pace.</p>