us on user-centric software development.</p></li><li><p>Understanding of event-driven programming and experience applying it in software development.</p></li><li><p>Experience working with Git version control.</p></li><li><p>Strong problem-solving and connected thinking skills.</p></li><li><p>A drive to write clean, high-quality code.</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working in a cross-functional team.</p></li><li><p>Good organizational skills and attention to detail.</p></li><li><p>Fluent in spoken and written English.</p></li><li><p>Interest in underwater robotics.</p></li></ul><p><strong><em>You don't meet every point exactly? Apply anyways!</em></strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Bonus points if you bring:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Knowledge of robotics middleware such as ROS/ROS2 and experience interfacing with live sensor data.</p></li><li><p>Experience with map rendering and interaction logic in both 2D and 3D.</p></li><li><p>Hands-on experience with drones or other robotic systems.</p></li><li><p>Experience with high-performance rendering or computationally intensive visualizations, such as compute shaders, graphics pipelines, or point clouds.</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of clean code practices and software design principles such as SOLID.</p></li><li><p>Experience with automated testing, CI/CD, or GitHub Actions.</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with concurrent programming.</p></li><li><p>Experience with Python.</p></li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><p>Collaborative culture where your ideas directly impact product development.</p></li><li><p>A dynamic, passionate and high-performance team with a strong builder mentality and flat hierarchies.</p></li><li><p>Streamlined decision-making processes, flat start-up hierarchies, and modern working methods that cultivate great ideas.</p></li><li><p>Exposure to cutting-edge robot technology and hands-on experience with real-world data processing and visualization.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Modern office in Schlieren, Zürich.</p></li><li><p>Attractive compensation in a startup environment.</p></li></ul><p></p><p>‍<strong>We value diversity:</strong></p><p>Tethys Robotics encourages an inclusive culture. We promote equality of opportunity, value diversity and nurture a working and learning environment in which the rights and dignity of all are respected.</p><p>‍</p><p><strong>Curious? So are we!</strong></p><p>We look forward to receiving your online application as we value the attitude over experience. In any case, please provide a full overview of the following documents – we value the completeness:</p><ul><li><p>Cover letter</p></li><li><p>Curriculum Vitae</p></li><li><p>Letter of reference / work certificates</p></li><li><p>Education certificates</p></li></ul><p>‍</p><p>-</p><p><em>Please note: We only accept applications via the online portal.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/tethys-robotics-ag/ui-software-engineer-80-100-schlieren-311928","tags":["Web Development"],"job_types":["Indefinite contract (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Schlieren","created_at":1792564251},{"slug":"polygrafin-oder-mediamatikerin-60-100-risch-rotkreuz-474724","company_name":"ANDERHUB DRUCK-SERVICE AG","title":"Polygraf:in oder Mediamatiker:in (60-100%)","description":"<p>Wir sind ein grafischer Familienbetrieb in zweiter Generation mit rund 20 Mitarbeitenden. Unsere Kundschaft ist anspruchsvoll und fordernd. Mit einem bestens ausgebildeten, motivierten Team und moderner Infrastruktur nehmen wir diese Herausforderung tagtäglich an.</p><p>Vervollständige unser 9-köpfiges Druckvorstufen- und Designwerkstatt-Team per 1. Dezember 2026 oder nach Vereinbarung als</p><h2><strong>Polygraf:in oder Mediamatiker:in </strong>(60-100%)</h2><p>Dein Aufgabengebiet ist vielseitig und abwechslungsreich. Neben der Datenkontrolle von angelieferten Druckdaten, gestaltest Du für Print