rs through setup. From configuring their warehouse to creating their first project.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build data migration tooling that lets customers import equipment, contacts, and projects reliably, with smart validation and clear, row-by-row error feedback.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make core interactions feel intuitive and modern. For example, redesigning flows like adding equipment into step-by-step wizards with contextual help.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remove every unnecessary obstacle between a new customer and their first successful project.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Roll out changes safely and validate impact (e.g. phasing from trial accounts to existing users) so improvements are proven before becoming the default.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with sales, support, and customer success to identify friction points and turn moments of confusion into moments of clarity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/d722c125-c3d1-4d3f-8dbf-08d8ac4ab137/4cbc15c2-ab17-4675-986f-17daed63cf06/20250812_4LF06474_ILCE-7M4Rentman.jpg" /></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What we are looking for </strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3 years of experience as a senior in a "product-led" development team/SaaS company</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience in contributing to a user-friendly solution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience dealing with complex business rules and data models</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven accountability for feature development solution &amp; success</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Positive mindset towards using AI in the development toolchain (The development landscape is changing rapidly, and at Rentman, we’re open to exploring how this can benefit us in our day-to-day work)</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">For us, having Angular experience is a nice-to-have. At Rentman, we believe that every good developer understands that a framework is a tool to help achieve results and that you can always learn a new framework if you have strong fundamentals.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Nice to haves</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backend experience (php/node) </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">SaaS customer onboarding experience </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">UX background</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What you’ll get </strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary based on experience, plus 8% holiday allowance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A results-based bonus based on company performance (up to a full 13th month's salary)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">25 vacation days to recharge</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Earn an extra day of PTO for each year at Rentman, from your second anniversary up to five years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A 4-week paid sabbatical after 5 years to go on an adventure</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible WFH policy &amp; work from anywhere for 4 weeks a year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pension plan through BrightPensioen</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An annual training budget to grow your skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Access to OpenUp for mental well-being and personal growth</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your choice of a shiny new Windows, Linux, or Mac</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay active with the team: join the Rentman football team, squash and padel, plus a discounted Urban Sports membership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An OV