dia production teams. Our users plan everything from small shoots to massive festivals in 70+ countries, and they all rely on Rentman to keep their gear, people, and timing perfectly in sync. We’re based in Utrecht (NL) with a second office in Toronto (CA), and our 100+ team members work in a culture that’s open, flat, and inclusive, where curiosity drives us, ownership matters, and everyone has the freedom to challenge ideas and make an impact. Check out our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://rentman.io/public-roadmap">public roadmap</a> to see what’s coming next!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/d722c125-c3d1-4d3f-8dbf-08d8ac4ab137/1abd1b97-44fa-4e7c-92e0-d04d95cf059f/Screenshot_2026-07-22_at_17.03.37.png" /></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Mission of this role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Product Marketing Manager, you drive revenue by leading the go-to-market of Rentman's new features, products and add-ons. You position each one so new customers buy in and existing customers add it to what they already use.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Without this role, no one leads the cross-functional push that grows revenue from both new and existing customers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you'll do</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop and refine Rentman’s messaging and positioning to clearly communicate the value of our products to key customer segments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a strong understanding of customer needs, pain points, and decision-making processes across our key markets and industries and educate other departments on the findings</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify the user value of new features, craft impactful messaging, and execute feature and product launches to drive awareness and adoption</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead product marketing content development, creating compelling and persuasive content to support product positioning, feature launches, and customer engagement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support our go-to-market (GTM) product initiatives, collaborating with cross-functional teams to ensure effective product positioning and rollout strategies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep all product documentation (internal and external) up to date, ensuring clear value propositions that align with brand standards</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/user-content/d722c125-c3d1-4d3f-8dbf-08d8ac4ab137/3c95dc18-9519-4446-b1af-13a805537681/Screenshot_2026-07-23_at_10.38.46.png" /></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What we are looking for </strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3+ years product marketing experience owning positioning, messaging, and go-to-market for product or feature launches (B2B SaaS preferred)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can point to specific launches they led and the adoption or revenue result</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written communication: clear, jargon-free messaging for varied audiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable using product usage data (e.g. Mixpanel) to define and track whether a launch worked</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Worked cross-functionally with Product, Sales, and Customer Success</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2><strong>Nice to haves</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience marketing monetized add-ons or features (expansion, not just adoption)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with the events/media production/rental industry, or a comparable vertical SaaS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.